<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Social welfare package to cost 139 mln punts - Quinn.</title>
<headline>Social welfare package to cost 139 mln punts - Quinn.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Irish finance minister Ruairi Quinn said that the total cost of the social welfare and health package announced in his 1997 budget was 139 million punts this year or 245 million in a full year.  </p>
<p>Nearly 600 million punts have been provided in full year terms in the last three budgets for social welfare improvements, Quinn said.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +3531 661 3377</p>
